The Identification Phase defines the problem and objectives of the project “ToyCraft Tales: Tableau's Vision into Toy Manufacturer Data.”

The main goal is to analyze toy manufacturer sales and production data using SQL and Tableau to generate meaningful insights.

In this phase, we identify the business problem, project scope, required data, stakeholders, and expected outcomes such as sales trends, profit analysis, and region-wise performance.

This phase lays the foundation for successful data analysis and dashboard development.
